So I step on a polymorph trap and get turned into a black dragon. So far, 
things are just swell. I lay an egg, figuring a pet dragon will be a nice 
thing to have around the house and eventually I turn back human and little
Oolong hatches and starts following me around. This is good. After a while I 
notice he isn't eating anything, which worries me, and I start heaving corpses 
at him, throwing him food rations, but no dice.

Eventually, he gets confused and starts attacking me, and I had to kill him. I
nearly died in the process, and an Ogre King came along and finished me off. 

So what's the scoop on keeping dragons as pets? Special food or something? Or 
just don't do it? It's not likely to come up again soon, but I'm curious.

